synopsis:
{Episode 26 - this is the 4th SP}
The Johnny's idol group SMAP commit a murder together and cover it up as suicide. Furuhata solves the case.
(Although this is the 26th aired episode, the events of this episode take place after the events of Episode #27)

{Episode 13}
This is Furuhata Ninzaburo 1st SP, aired between the 1st and 2nd seasons.
It's also the first episode set abroad.

{Episode 39}
This is the 6th SP episode, aired five years after the third season and two years before the "Final Series".
It's the third (and last) episode of the whole "Furuhata Ninzaburo" franchise that portrays a case taking place outside of Japan.
